        "answer": "Builds CoD.WZ_AARCharacterContainerInternal from the supplied eight layout bounds; f1_arg0 is the menu and f1_arg1 the controller. Creates/adds/publishes children in source order: IGRbg, CharacterUnlocks, Title. Exact eager setup, property/asset values, each owned callback, guard and return are retained in the ordered source trace. CharacterUnlocks uses WZAAR_UnlockedCharacter and CharacterUnlock. gameScore.currentState updates its datasource only when IsInGame; it adds the rewards title and close hook. Calls the shown optional load hook at its exact source position, then returns self. Child/base/provider lifetime and callback invocation remain conditional.",
